BooCue uses the ghost brand icon and semantic sound/control icons from
Material Design Icons / Pictogrammers.
Source: https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign-SVG/blob/master/svg/ghost.svg
Material Design Icons are licensed under the Apache License 2.0.
Upstream license: https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign-SVG/blob/master/LICENSE
The icon's shape is retained; BooCue supplies the color treatment.

The isolated development preview also bundles Material Design Icons path data
from the @mdi/js package. The same upstream license and attribution apply.

The 60 MP3 recordings in custom_components/boocue/assets/audio/ and their
hh-fx* and hh-mood* cue sequences in assets/pack.json are third-party assets
redistributed with permission. They are excluded from BooCue's MIT license.
Their separate notice is assets/LICENSE-AUDIO.txt within the integration;
BooCue grants no additional rights to those assets.
